  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Navigation: flight time along a parallel</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.7 (e) / Essential 2.3 (e): Find the distance flown along a parallel of latitude in nautical miles and the time taken at a given speed in knots.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
